{"book":"1-samuel","model":"glm-4.5","timestamp":"2026-05-03T07:06:55.342229299Z","verse":29,"ref":"1-samuel 20:29","tier":"bulk","chapter":20,"translation":"And he said, 'Send me away, I pray, for ⟨there is⟩ a family sacrifice for us in the city, and he, my brother, has commanded me; and now, if I have found favor in your eyes, let me escape, I pray, and I will see ⟨את⟩ my brother.' On account of this, he has not come to the table of the king.","tokens":[{"surface":"ויאמר","gloss":"And he said"},{"surface":"שלחני","gloss":"Send me away"},{"surface":"נא","gloss":"I pray"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"for"},{"surface":"זבח","gloss":"sacrifice"},{"surface":"משפחה","gloss":"family"},{"surface":"לנו","gloss":"for us"},{"surface":"בעיר","gloss":"in the city"},{"surface":"והוא","gloss":"and he himself"},{"surface":"צוה","gloss":"has commanded"},{"surface":"לי","gloss":"⟨me⟩"},{"surface":"אחי","gloss":"my brother"},{"surface":"ועתה","gloss":"and now"},{"surface":"אם","gloss":"if"},{"surface":"מצאתי","gloss":"I have found"},{"surface":"חן","gloss":"favor"},{"surface":"בעיניך","gloss":"in your eyes"},{"surface":"אמלטה","gloss":"let me escape"},{"surface":"נא","gloss":"I pray"},{"surface":"ואראה","gloss":"and I will see"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"my brother"},{"surface":"אחי","gloss":"my brother"},{"surface":"על","gloss":"upon"},{"surface":"כן","gloss":"therefore"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"בא","gloss":"he has come"},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"to"},{"surface":"שלחן","gloss":"table"},{"surface":"המלך","gloss":"of the king"}]}